  "title": "Release-control walkthrough",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Release-control walkthrough</h2><p>Review a release process and identify the most appropriate control improvement.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m1-tbs4-f1\">Improve deployment approval</label><select id=\"isc-m1-tbs4-f1\"><option value=\"Use appropriate independent authorization\">Use appropriate independent authorization</option><option value=\"Rely solely on the developer’s preference\">Rely solely on the developer’s preference</option><option value=\"Remove all approvals\">Remove all approvals</option><option value=\"Assume version control is approval\">Assume version control is approval</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m1-tbs4-f2\">Improve testing evidence</label><select id=\"isc-m1-tbs4-f2\"><option value=\"Retain relevant test results and acceptance approval\">Retain relevant test results and acceptance approval</option><option value=\"Use only a code timestamp\">Use only a code timestamp</option><option value=\"Skip business testing\">Skip business testing</option><option value=\"Delete failed test results\">Delete failed test results</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m1-tbs4-f3\">Improve configuration control</label><select id=\"isc-m1-tbs4-f3\"><option value=\"Authorize, log, and monitor configuration changes\">Authorize, log, and monitor configuration changes</option><option value=\"Ignore changes that are not code\">Ignore changes that are not code</option><option value=\"Give every user administrator access\">Give every user administrator access</option><option value=\"Disable audit logs\">Disable audit logs</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m1-tbs4-f4\">Improve emergency handling</label><select id=\"isc-m1-tbs4-f4\"><option value=\"Document emergency authorization and retrospective review\">Document emergency authorization and retrospective review</option><option value=\"Allow permanent unreviewed exceptions\">Allow permanent unreviewed exceptions</option><option value=\"Assume emergencies have no risks\">Assume emergencies have no risks</option><option value=\"Omit recovery planning\">Omit recovery planning</option></select></div></section>",
