    {
      "id": "isc-m1-tbs4-ex1",
      "title": "Release evidence",
      "html": "<p>Code is stored in version control, but developers approve their own production deployments. No acceptance-test evidence is retained. Configuration changes are not logged. Emergency changes have no subsequent review.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "isc-m1-tbs4-ex2",
      "title": "Objectives",
      "html": "<p>Only authorized, tested, approved changes should reach production, and failures should be recoverable.</p>"
    }
