  "explanation": "<h3>Improve deployment approval</h3><p>Independent authorization helps prevent self-approved changes.</p><h3>Improve testing evidence</h3><p>Evidence should support whether acceptance criteria were met.</p><h3>Improve configuration control</h3><p>Configuration can materially change system behavior.</p><h3>Improve emergency handling</h3><p>Expedited changes still need accountable control.</p>"
